Skills: Languages

Purpose:
  Programming language skills organized by competency layers (L1-L5).
  Each language has layered skills from fundamentals to architecture.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1  @INDEX.sdd
   2  @go/
   3  @java/
   4  @python/
   5  @typescript/
   6  @javascript/

Modes:
  LEARN    — learn language fundamentals
  APPLY    — apply language to current task
  REVIEW   — review language skills for updates
  UPGRADE  — propose skill upgrade

Rules:
  [L1]  Skills MUST be organized by language.
  [L2]  Each language MUST have L1-L5 layers.
  [L3]  Layer MUST match developer competency level.
  [L4]  Skills MUST be loaded on demand.
  [L5]  Language skills MUST NOT contain framework-specific content.

Entry:
  Read:
    INDEX.sdd

  Resolve:
    go
    java
    python
    typescript
    javascript

